  "id": "USN-8524-1",
  "summary": "python2.7, python3.5 vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Python did not use sufficient entropy for Expat\nhash-flooding protection in the xml.parsers.expat and xml.etree.ElementTree\nmodules. An attacker could use this to cause a denial of service via a\ncrafted XML document.",
